.MARINE...
(Today through Thursday)
Issued at 856 AM PDT Sat Sep 12 2026

Hazardous conditions for small craft prevail this weekend through
the middle of next week. Winds increase today with a strong
breeze to develop by early Sunday and continue into the middle of
next week. Widespread near gale force gusts are likely Sunday into
early Monday with gale force gusts are expected along the inner
waters from Pigeon Point to Point Piedras Blancas, the Monterey
Bay, and in portions of the San Francisco and San Pablo Bays.
Moderate seas will build, becoming rough by Monday in response to
the stronger winds.

